 {'id':'paths','label':'Mayor’s Office · separate bridge walking and cycling space','href':'https://www.nyc.gov/mayors-office/news/2025/05/mayor-adams-dot-commissioner-rodriguez-doubling-pedestrian-cycling-space-on'},
